    title: "نکات قرارداد کار با پرسنل خارجی",
    content: "<p>Points to consider in employment contracts with foreign personnel are as follows:</p><ul>\n<li>The employment contract to be signed between the خارجی and the کارفرما must comply with the Labour Law and other legislation,</li>\n\n\n\n<li>The wage to be paid to the خارجی in the employment contract must not be below the mandatory minimum wages specified in the وزارت's evaluation criteria (these wages are explained in a subsection below),</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Depending on the sectors in which the خارجی will work, if recruitment was made according to the person's qualifications, he or she must be employed in an appropriate job, and necessary arrangements must be made in the employment contract where required.</li>\n</ul>",
