    content: "<p>The wage determined for foreign personnel must be commensurate with the خارجی's duty and competence. Accordingly, taking into account the minimum wage in force on the application date, the wage to be paid to the خارجی must be at least the amounts specified below.</p><ul>\n<li><strong>6.5 times</strong> the minimum wage for senior executives and pilots (from 01.01.2023 <strong>gross 65,052.00 TL</strong>),</li>\n</ul><ul>\n<li><strong>4 times</strong> the minimum wage for unit or branch managers, engineers and architects (from 01.01.2023 <strong>gross 40,032.00 TL</strong>),</li>\n</ul><ul>\n<li><strong>3 times</strong> the minimum wage for those working in jobs requiring expertise and craftsmanship and for teachers (from 01.01.2023 <strong>gross 30,024.00 TL</strong>),</li>\n</ul><ul>\n<li><strong>at least the minimum wage</strong> for خارجیs employed in domestic services (from 01.01.2023 <strong>gross 10,008.00 TL</strong>), and <strong>1.5 times</strong> the minimum wage for خارجیs working in other professions (from 01.01.2023 <strong>gross 15,012.00 TL</strong>),</li>\n</ul><ul>\n<li><strong>2 times</strong> the minimum wage for خارجیs working as acrobats and in similar titles at tourism-animation organisation firms and for masseurs, masseuses and SPA therapists (from 01.01.2023 <strong>gross 20,016.00 TL</strong>).</li>\n</ul><p>The wage to be paid to the خارجی must be correctly stated in the employment contract according to the various professions listed above. Arranging the wage to be paid to the خارجی below these amounts in the employment contract is grounds for rejection of the مجوز کار application.</p>",
