    title: "هزینه‌ها و عوارض مجوز کار",
    content: "<p>Various fees and charges must be paid on first مجوز کار applications and extension applications. Valid foreign مجوز کار fees, charges and costs for 2023 are given in the table below.</p>PERMIT TYPE/DURATIONFEE AND CHARGE AMOUNT (TL)Temporary/ up to 1 year (including 1 year),3,090.20,Temporary/ more than 1 year and 2-year permit,6,180.40Temporary/ more than 2 years and 3-year permit,9,270.60,Temporary/ more than 3 years and 4-year permit,12,360.80,Temporary/ more than 4 years and 5-year permit,15,451.00,Indefinite,30,914.50,Independent,30,914.50,Temporary Protection Work Permit/ 1 year (Standard),1149.60.<p>In addition to the fees listed above, the valuable paper charge must also be paid. As of 01.01.2023, the valuable paper charge for the foreign مجوز کار document is 356 TL.</p><p><strong>توجه: </strong>If the requested fee and valuable paper charge are not paid within <strong>30 days</strong> from the notification date, the خارجی's مجوز کار application is removed from processing. Therefore, attention must be paid to paying the requested fee and valuable paper charge separately within this period.</p>",
