    content: "<p>Rejection of a مجوز کار extension application arises for reasons such as failure to apply within the period, failure to apply in the manner prescribed in legislation or failure to obtain documents required for the application.</p><p>A خارجی whose مجوز کار extension application is rejected may object to this decision or bring دعوای ابطال. Use of these legal remedies follows the same procedure as rejection of a foreign مجوز کار application explained above.</p>",
